                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really enjoyed Opposing Force, i found it really interesting to play through the same events as in Half Life from the perspective of an HECU soldier, mainly because you end up seeing various situations in a different light, the range of new weapons is also one of the things I liked best, and the new enemies make the combat more varied, the sections where other soldiers help out are also really cool and give a different feel to the original campaign, its a relatively short campaign, but I thought the pacing worked really well and there were hardly any parts that dragged on, some of the mechanics are a bit odd and you can tell its a game from that era, but nothing that spoiled my experience.",
